 "description": "Locally normalized geometric descriptors of 3\u2013256 planar points: distances, nearest-neighbour isolation, centroid spread, PCA collinearity and histogram. The principal-axis mirror residual is null for isotropic noncoincident covariance, whose axes are undetermined. Rounded fingerprints are descriptive, not proofs of equivalence or method benefit.",
